  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Slice pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: Peel the pumpkin, if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d2b4edc533226ca9134d0-926d6828.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice red onion into wedges.\n• Cut cauliflower (including the stalk!) into small florets.\n• Roughly chop walnuts.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d2b4edc533226ca9134d0-86504b4f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place snacking tomatoes, onion and cauliflower on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, in a small bowl combine plant-based pesto and plant-based mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d2b4edc533226ca9134d0-953579db.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, combine the water and vegetable stock pot and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until the water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with fork.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Remove pan from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d2b4edc533226ca9134d0-a683e323.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the couscous is ready, add roasted tomatoes, cauliflower, onion and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar to the pan.\n• Toss to coat and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d2b4edc533226ca9134d0-3c74c828.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide veggie pearl couscous between bowls. Top with garlicky roast pumpkin and haloumi. Dollop with plant-based mayo.\n• Drizzle with plant-based basil pesto and sprinkle with chopped walnuts to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d2b4edc533226ca9134d0-c618e873.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
